data.value:
In this installer, you will be prompted to set the retention time for media, which may potentially contain personal data. If you are subject to the EU General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”), the system may not be compliant with the GDPR if the retention time is too long.
For more information on how you can work with GDPR compliance, including retention times, when using the {0} VMS, please see our GDPR Privacy Guide: {1}
Our GDPR Privacy Guide is intended for general information purposes only, and you are responsible for compliance with applicable laws concerning personal data. Retention periods may, among other things, depend on the purpose of the system and the purpose of your data processing. You may consult the relevant Data Protection Authority to receive guidance on local laws.
